{"is":"issue","title":"Openvscode-server Deprecation Notice","body":"\u003cp\u003eDue to the upstream project no longer updating their app, we have decided to deprecate our \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/linuxserver/docker-openvscode-server\"\u003eOpenvscode-server\u003c/a\u003e image. We recommend switching to the \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/linuxserver/docker-code-server\"\u003eCode-server\u003c/a\u003e or the \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/linuxserver/docker-vscodium-web\"\u003eVSCodium-web\u003c/a\u003e image.\u003c/p\u003e\n","createdAt":"2026-07-16 22:00:00 +0000 UTC","lastMod":"2026-07-16 10:01:29 -0400 -0400","permalink":"https://info.linuxserver.io/issues/2026-07-16-openvscode-server/","severity":"<no value>","resolved":false,"informational":true,"resolvedAt":"<no value>","affected":["Deprecations","openvscode-server"],"filename":"2026-07-16-openvscode-server.md"}